                                "sense_id": "48c9bdf3-eaeb-3dd5-88f8-44b8788aa0f2",
                                "text": "He sat in a wheely chair just inside the door, spinning one way and the other, lifting up his knees to spin faster."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2347e754-8a27-4219-ba2c-4d437158e13d",
                                "sense_id": "48c9bdf3-eaeb-3dd5-88f8-44b8788aa0f2",
                                "text": "Thanks to those with their wheely suitcases, navigating around Midtown Manhattan, especially at this time of year, is like playing a game of dodge 'em."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "340342c1-e4a9-441e-a4da-abc7a24ce915",
                                "sense_id": "48c9bdf3-eaeb-3dd5-88f8-44b8788aa0f2",
                                "text": "\"Let's go!\" Jane added with a big smile. With one hand she dragged my wheely suitcase. With the other she took Gianna's hand and led us out of the airport."
                            }
                        ]
